["<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">場合</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ばあい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">情况；场合；情形；状况</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"216182\">システムが<ruby>作動<rp>(</rp><rt>さどう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>しない<ruby>場合<rp>(</rp><rt>ばあい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>がある。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">系统可能不起作用。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">倍</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ばい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">两倍；双倍；倍；倍数；n分之一；n分之一的</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"230998\">あの<ruby>山<rp>(</rp><rt>やま</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はこの<ruby>山<rp>(</rp><rt>やま</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の５<ruby>倍<rp>(</rp><rt>ばい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>高<rp>(</rp><rt>たか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>さである。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">那座山比这座山高五倍。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">バイオリン</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">小提琴</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"91768\"><ruby>彼女<rp>(</rp><rt>かのじょ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はバイオリンが<ruby>大変<rp>(</rp><rt>たいへん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>上手<rp>(</rp><rt>じょうず</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>です。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">她小提琴演奏得非常好。 <a class=\"ex-attribution\" href=\"https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/851475\" title=\"Tatoeba · Martha\" aria-label=\"Tatoeba · Martha\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">↗</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">黴菌</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ばいきん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">细菌；病菌；微生物；脏东西；有害物质；害虫</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">賠償</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ばいしょう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">赔偿；赔款；补偿金</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"109026\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>怪我<rp>(</rp><rt>けが</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>賠償<rp>(</rp><rt>ばいしょう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>として<ruby>多額<rp>(</rp><rt>たがく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>金<rp>(</rp><rt>かね</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>受<rp>(</rp><rt>う</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>け<ruby>取<rp>(</rp><rt>と</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>った。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">他因受伤而获得了大量的赔偿金。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">売店</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ばいてん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">售货亭；小卖部；摊位；售卖亭</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"234690\">アイスクリーム<ruby>売<rp>(</rp><rt>う</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>りが<ruby>外<rp>(</rp><rt>そと</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>売店<rp>(</rp><rt>ばいてん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>で<ruby>客<rp>(</rp><rt>きゃく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>にアイスクリームを<ruby>売<rp>(</rp><rt>う</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>っている。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">冰淇淋商家在外店向客户出售冰淇淋。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">バイバイ</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">感叹词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">感動詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">再见；拜拜；道别；告别</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"74620\"><ruby>診察室<rp>(</rp><rt>しんさつしつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>出<rp>(</rp><rt>で</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>る<ruby>間際<rp>(</rp><rt>まぎわ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>、<ruby>先生<rp>(</rp><rt>せんせい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が「バイバイ」と<ruby>手<rp>(</rp><rt>て</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>振<rp>(</rp><rt>ふ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ってくださいました。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">离开诊所的时候,老师伸出“再见”的手。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">売買</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ばいばい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">买卖；贸易；交易（如人口贩运、军火走私、毒品贩运等）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"108903\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>革製品<rp>(</rp><rt>かわせいひん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>売買<rp>(</rp><rt>ばいばい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>をしている。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">他正在销售皮革产品。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">倍率</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ばいりつ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">放大倍数；放大倍率；缩放因子；杠杆倍率；报考倍率；竞争率（报考人数与录取人数之比）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">馬鹿</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ばか</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">白痴；傻瓜；愚人；愚蠢的；傻的；呆板的；荒唐的；可笑的；微不足道的；琐碎的；令人失望的；失灵的；故障的；感觉迟钝的；极其；异常；非常；狂热爱好者；迷；痴迷于某事的人；中国蛤蜊（学名 Mactra chinensis）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"94885\"><ruby>彼女<rp>(</rp><rt>かのじょ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>にまた<ruby>会<rp>(</rp><rt>あ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>うなんて<ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>馬鹿<rp>(</rp><rt>ばか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>だ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">她很愚蠢能再次见到她。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">馬鹿馬鹿しい</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ばかばかしい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">い形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">い形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">荒谬；可笑；愚蠢；荒唐；愚不可及</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"198292\">ばかばかしいとしか<ruby>言<rp>(</rp><rt>い</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いようがない。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我只能说是愚蠢的。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">ばからしい</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">い形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">い形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">荒唐；愚蠢；愚笨；可笑；无稽；滑稽；荒谬</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">漠然</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ばくぜん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"v-m\">模糊；朦胧；不清楚；含混</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">莫大</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ばくだい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">な形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">な形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">广大；巨大；庞大；浩大；胖大海（Scaphium affine）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">爆弾</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ばくだん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">炸弹；掺烈酒的饮料（尤指以葡萄酒为基酒的烧酎高球鸡尾酒，也指啤酒兑威士忌）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"220204\">この<ruby>爆弾<rp>(</rp><rt>ばくだん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はたくさんの<ruby>人<rp>(</rp><rt>ひと</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>殺<rp>(</rp><rt>ころ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>すことができる。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">这种炸弹可以杀死许多人。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">爆破</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ばくは</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">爆破；炸毁；爆炸</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"170177\"><ruby>作業員<rp>(</rp><rt>さぎょういん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>岩<rp>(</rp><rt>いわ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>爆破<rp>(</rp><rt>ばくは</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>しているのを<ruby>見<rp>(</rp><rt>み</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>た。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我看到了工人正在爆炸岩石。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">爆発</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ばくはつ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">爆炸；爆发；（情绪的）爆发；（愤怒的）爆发；（不满的）爆发</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"212813\">そのニュースは<ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>怒<rp>(</rp><rt>いか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>りを<ruby>爆発<rp>(</rp><rt>ばくはつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>させた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">消息激发了他的愤怒。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">暴露</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ばくろ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">泄露；曝光；揭露</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"202652\">ついに<ruby>正体<rp>(</rp><rt>しょうたい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>暴露<rp>(</rp><rt>ばくろ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>したな。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">终于揭示了自己的真实性。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">バケツ</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">桶；水桶</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"111303\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はバケツに<ruby>水<rp>(</rp><rt>みず</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>をいっぱい<ruby>入<rp>(</rp><rt>い</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>れた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">他把水填满了袋子里。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">化ける</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ばける</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">（尤指妖怪、狐狸、貉等）变身成；化作；变成；化身为；伪装成；装扮成；变化；转变；变形；蜕变；（尤指演员、运动员、股价等）彻底改变；焕然一新；急剧好转；大翻身</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"121950\"><ruby>猫<rp>(</rp><rt>ねこ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>化<rp>(</rp><rt>ば</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>けると<ruby>言<rp>(</rp><rt>い</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>われる。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">有人说,猫可以生气。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">場所</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ばしょ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">地方；场所</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\"><ruby>集<rp>(</rp><rt>あつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>まる<ruby>場所<rp>(</rp><rt>ばしょ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>教<rp>(</rp><rt>おし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>えてください。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">请告诉我集合的地方。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">バス</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">公共汽车；巴士；公交车；（计算机）总线</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">バター</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">黄油；牛油</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"198015\">バターはミルクから<ruby>出来<rp>(</rp><rt>でき</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>る。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">玉米可以用牛奶。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">罰</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ばち</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">(神的)惩罚；诅咒；报应</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">バック</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">后面；背部；背景；背景幕；支持；支持者；后盾；倒车；倒退；后退；倒挡；倒车挡；退款；返利；后卫；背泳；仰泳；反手；后入式</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">バッグ</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">袋子；包</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"197972\">バッグはどこに<ruby>置<rp>(</rp><rt>お</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>けばいいですか。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我应该把行李箱放在哪里?</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">バッジ</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">徽章；证章</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"127175\"><ruby>男子生徒<rp>(</rp><rt>だんしせいと</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>のめいめいが<ruby>帽子<rp>(</rp><rt>ぼうし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>学校<rp>(</rp><rt>がっこう</rt><rp>)</rp></r